  "description": "The Republic of Korea Army has approximately 320,000 members. What are the odds of running into an ex-boyfriend you broke up with four years ago among so many units? Corporal Chae Min-Hyeok, a non-commissioned officer, has just been assigned to 2nd Company. While wandering around lost, he stumbles into a warehouse and witnesses his ex-boyfriend, Seo Tae-Kyung, whom he broke up with four years ago, receiving oral sex. Min-Hyeok tries to make a quick escape, claiming he didn’t mean to interrupt their intimate moment, but Tae-Kyung, as if he’d been waiting for this, grabs him without mercy and stops him in his tracks.\n\n*“If you’re that sorry, why don’t you do it for me?”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
